@startuml
title Update Word Audio Sequence (/api/admin/words/{id}/audio)
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor Admin
boundary "Vocabulary UI" as VocabularyPage
control "VocabularyController\n(FE Dashboard)" as DashboardController
entity "WordDetail\n(FE Response DTO)" as FeWordDetailDto
entity "UploadWordAudioRequest\n(BE Request DTO)" as AudioRequestDto
entity "WordAudioResponse\n(BE Response DTO)" as AudioResponseDto
control "AdminWordsController\n(BE API)" as ApiController
control "WordAdminService" as WordService
control "IWordAdminService" as IWordAdminService
control "IWordAudioStorage" as IWordAudioStorage
entity "Word" as WordEntity
entity "WordAudioAsset" as WordAudioAsset
control "WordAdminRepository" as WordRepository
control "IWordAdminRepository" as IWordAdminRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL
note over VocabularyPage, MySQL
Checked in current code:
Create audio and update audio use the same upload/upsert flow.
Dashboard VocabularyController uploads audio file through VocaNovaApiClient.
Dashboard currently sends accent = "us" for the upload.
API endpoint is POST /api/admin/words/{id}/audio.
API uses UploadWordAudioRequest and returns WordAudioResponse.
FE response DTO exists: WordDetail when Dashboard reloads word detail.
Interfaces used in code: IWordAdminService, IWordAdminRepository, IWordAudioStorage.
end note
Admin -> VocabularyPage: Choose replacement audio file
Admin -> VocabularyPage: Click Upload audio
VocabularyPage -> DashboardController: POST /vocabulary/{id}/audio
DashboardController -> DashboardController: Validate file exists
alt No audio file selected
DashboardController --> VocabularyPage: Show error message
else Audio file selected
DashboardController -> AudioRequestDto: VocaNovaApiClient.UploadAudioAsync(wordId, audio file)\nCreate multipart request(accent = "us", file)
AudioRequestDto -> ApiController: POST /api/admin/words/{id}/audio\nUploadWordAudioRequest
ApiController -> ApiController: Check admin authorization
ApiController -> ApiController: Bind UploadWordAudioRequest
ApiController -> IWordAdminService: UploadAudioAsync(wordId, accent, file)
IWordAdminService -> WordService: UploadAudioAsync(wordId, accent, file)
WordService -> WordService: Normalize accent\nand validate audio file
alt Accent or audio file invalid
WordService --> ApiController: Validation failure
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 400 error
DashboardController --> VocabularyPage: Show error message
else Audio file valid
WordService -> IWordAdminRepository: WordExistsAsync(wordId)
IWordAdminRepository -> WordRepository: WordExistsAsync(wordId)
WordRepository -> DbContext: Query word
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT words
MySQL --> DbContext: Word row or null
DbContext -> WordEntity: Materialize Word?
WordEntity --> DbContext: Word or null
DbContext --> WordRepository: Result
WordRepository --> WordService: exists or not
alt Word not found
WordService --> ApiController: NotFound result
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 404 error
DashboardController --> VocabularyPage: Show error message
else Word exists
WordService -> IWordAudioStorage: UploadAsync(file, accent)
WordService -> IWordAdminRepository: UpsertAudioAsync(wordId, uploaded audio, accent)
IWordAdminRepository -> WordRepository: UpsertAudioAsync(wordId, uploaded audio, accent)
WordRepository -> DbContext: Find audio asset by word and accent
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT word_audio_assets
MySQL --> DbContext: Audio row or null
DbContext -> WordAudioAsset: Materialize WordAudioAsset?
WordAudioAsset --> DbContext: WordAudioAsset or null
DbContext --> WordRepository: Result
alt Audio asset does not exist
WordRepository -> WordAudioAsset: Create WordAudioAsset
WordAudioAsset --> WordRepository: WordAudioAsset
WordRepository -> DbContext: Add word audio asset
DbContext -> MySQL: INSERT word_audio_assets
MySQL --> DbContext: Insert result
else Audio asset exists
WordRepository -> WordAudioAsset: Replace storage URL\nand mark uploaded
WordAudioAsset --> WordRepository: WordAudioAsset updated
WordRepository -> DbContext: Track audio asset update
DbContext -> MySQL: UPDATE word_audio_assets
MySQL --> DbContext: Update result
end
DbContext --> WordRepository: Save result
WordRepository --> WordService: WordAudio
WordService --> ApiController: Return updated audio
ApiController -> AudioResponseDto: Create response data(WordAudioResponse)
AudioResponseDto --> DashboardController: HTTP 200 OK\nWordAudioResponse
DashboardController -> FeWordDetailDto: VocaNovaApiClient.GetWordDetailAsync(wordId)\nGET /api/words/{id}
FeWordDetailDto --> DashboardController: WordDetail
DashboardController --> VocabularyPage: Show updated audio
end
end
end
@enduml
